## Author-candidate study result

`STUDY_STATUS=AUTHOR_CANDIDATE`

`STUDY_RESULT=EVIDENCE_GAP_CONFIRMED_ACQUISITION_SPECIFICATION_READY`

This result means that the current accounting-satisfaction evidence gap is
sufficiently characterized to specify what a future evidence-acquisition and
satisfaction-evaluation transaction would require.

It does not mean that the missing evidence has been acquired.

